<span id="amdgpu-synid-gfx11-saddr-8a0af3"></span><h1>saddr<a class="headerlink" href="#saddr" title="Link to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<p>An optional 32-bit flat scratch offset. Must be specified as <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUOperandSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-off"><span class="std std-ref">off</span></a> if not used.</p>
<ul class="simple">
<li><p>Offset = [<a class="reference internal" href="gfx11_vaddr_6ab80d.html#amdgpu-synid-gfx11-vaddr-6ab80d"><span class="std std-ref">vaddr</span></a>] + [<a class="reference internal" href="#amdgpu-synid-gfx11-saddr-8a0af3"><span class="std std-ref">saddr</span></a>] + <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUModifierSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-flat-offset13s"><span class="std std-ref">offset13s</span></a>.</p></li>
</ul>
<p><em>Size:</em> 1 dword.</p>
<p><em>Operands:</em> <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUOperandSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-s"><span class="std std-ref">s</span></a>, <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUOperandSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-vcc"><span class="std std-ref">vcc</span></a>, <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUOperandSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-ttmp"><span class="std std-ref">ttmp</span></a>, <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUOperandSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-null"><span class="std std-ref">null</span></a>, <a class="reference internal" href="../AMDGPUOperandSyntax.html#amdgpu-synid-off"><span class="std std-ref">off</span></a></p>
