	// The Barret reduction algorithm is defined as:
	//
	//    1. T1(x) = floor( R(x) / x^32 ) GF2MUL u
	//    2. T2(x) = floor( T1(x) / x^32 ) GF2MUL P(x)
	//    3. C(x)  = R(x) XOR T2(x) mod x^32
