<span id="prop_test:COST"></span><h1>COST<a class="headerlink" href="#cost" title="Link to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<p>This property describes the cost of a test.  When parallel testing is
enabled, tests in the test set will be run in descending order of cost.
Projects can explicitly define the cost of a test by setting this property
to a floating point value.</p>
<p>When the cost of a test is not defined by the project,
<span class="target" id="index-0-manual:ctest(1)"></span><a class="reference internal" href="../manual/ctest.1.html#manual:ctest(1)" title="ctest(1)"><code class="xref cmake cmake-manual docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">ctest</span></code></a> will initially use a default cost of <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">0</span></code>.
It computes a weighted average of the cost each time a test is run and
