  <section id="vs-source-settings-tool">
<span id="prop_tgt:VS_SOURCE_SETTINGS_<tool>"></span><h1>VS_SOURCE_SETTINGS_&lt;tool&gt;<a class="headerlink" href="#vs-source-settings-tool" title="Link to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<div class="versionadded">
<p><span class="versionmodified added">New in version 3.18.</span></p>
</div>
<p>Set any item metadata on all non-built files that use &lt;tool&gt;.</p>
<p>Takes a list of <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Key=Value</span></code> pairs. Tells the Visual Studio generator
to set <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Key</span></code> to <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Value</span></code> as item metadata on all non-built files
that use <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">&lt;tool&gt;</span></code>.</p>
<p>For example:</p>
<div class="highlight-cmake notranslate"><div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><span class="nf">set_property(</span><span class="no">TARGET</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nb">main</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="no">PROPERTY</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nb">VS_SOURCE_SETTINGS_FXCompile</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&quot;Key=Value&quot;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&quot;Key2=Value2&quot;</span><span class="nf">)</span>
</pre></div>
</div>
<p>will set <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Key</span></code> to <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Value</span></code> and <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Key2</span></code> to <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Value2</span></code> for all
non-built files that use <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">FXCompile</span></code>.</p>
<p><span class="target" id="index-0-manual:cmake-generator-expressions(7)"></span><a class="reference internal" href="../manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.html#manual:cmake-generator-expressions(7)" title="cmake-generator-expressions(7)"><code class="xref cmake cmake-manual docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Generator</span> <span class="pre">expressions</span></code></a> are supported.</p>
</section>


